{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"ef26766f6f81a9dd","name":"card_unit_164th_infantry_regiment","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/USA/ToW/units/card_unit_164th_infantry_regiment","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"164th INFANTRY REGIMENT","text":"Destruction: Give a random friendly unit +1+1.","flavorText":"In 1942 the 164th Infantry Regiment along with the 182nd, 132nd Infantry Regiment plus artillery and support units formed the Americal Division of the US Army. In October 1942 the division landed on Guadalcanal as an emergency reinforcement to the 1st Marine Division and became the first US Army unit to engage in combat in the Guadalcanal Campaign. The 164th fought alongside the Marines on the island and saw fierce fighting, at first they managed to withstand repeated assaults by the Japanese and later they participated in jungle patroles in an attempt to eliminate resistance on the island. After the Battle of Guadalcanal the 164th Regiment had gained valuable experience in jungle warfare. The regiment fought in the Bougainville campaign as part of the 5307th Composite Unit (AKA Merrill’s Marauders) which was a special operations jungle warfare unit.","faction":"USA","type":"infantry","rarity":"Common","cost":1,"operationCost":0,"attack":1,"defense":1},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_unit_164th_infantry_regiment","title":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_unit_164th_infantry_regiment_title","SourceString":"164th INFANTRY REGIMENT","LocalizedString":"164th INFANTRY REGIMENT"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::infantry","attack":1,"defense":1,"range":1,"faction":"EFactionEnum::USA","kredits":1,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_unit_164th_infantry_regiment_text","SourceString":"Destruction: Give a random friendly unit +1+1.","LocalizedString":"Destruction: Give a random friendly unit +1+1."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_usa","Key":"card_unit_164th_infantry_regiment_history","SourceString":"In 1942 the 164th Infantry Regiment a